# KoyaKart brand color

**Primary theme / accent:** `#009111`

Use for buttons, links, selected states, success accents, and checkout highlights unless a screen intentionally uses town-level `themeColor` override.

## Implementation

- Portal tokens: `web/*/src/shared/theme/tokens.ts` → `color.accent`, `hero`, `info`, `success` (and derived hover/soft).
- Shared accent preset **forest / KoyaKart**: `web/shared/theme/presets.ts`.
- Town default seed: `#009111` in town-service when no custom town color.
- Prefer **`var(--accent)`** and theme tokens in UI (`ui-theme.mdc`); use raw `#009111` only where third-party embeds require hex (e.g. Razorpay) or tokens are unavailable.

## Derived palette (reference)

| Role | Hex |
|------|-----|
| Accent | `#009111` |
| Accent hover / deep | `#007A0E` |
| Accent soft background | `#E5F5E7` |

Do not reintroduce legacy green `#0C831F` for new work.
